  },
  {
   "id": 223,
   "en": "Operator",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 224,
   "en": "Commander, the <Cross Gate>'s energy readings@have dropped to normal levels.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 225,
   "en": "Humphrey",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 226,
   "en": "Normal, is it?@It hasn't been long since that Gate@appeared in low orbit.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 227,
   "en": "Frankly, that light burst was unexpected.@I thought many objects like the <Ruina>@would come out of the Cross Gate...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 228,
   "en": "A few probably did.@But our radar and sensors were disrupted,@so we never learned what they were.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 229,
   "en": "Understood...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 230,
   "en": "In any case, we have far too little data on the Cross@Gate. With only the Steel Dragons' reports from <The@Sealing War>, it's hard to predict what will happen.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 231,
   "en": "Just as a full study was about to begin,@that light burst happened...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 232,
   "en": "Wh-What...?!@Warrior 1, respond! What are you doing?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 233,
   "en": "What's wrong? Report the situation.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 234,
   "en": "All of Becam Platoon is attacking@their mothership, the Bluegrin!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "Are you sure it's Becam Platoon?@Could it be a hostile, like the Zovorg?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "Becam Platoon only just@launched from the Bluegrin!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "Then the whole platoon is mutinying...?!@Can't we get a feed from inside the cockpits?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "Commander!@All of Iba Platoon and Rate Platoon are leaving Area 3!@They're not answering our calls!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "Ngh, what in the world is going on...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "Cross Gate Space",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "Steel Dragons",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
