   "en": "Eita",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "Isn't it a mock battle or training?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "There's no way they'd do that in this situation.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "Well, that's true...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "From what I heard on the comms,@the watch fleet seems to be in chaos.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "Understood.@Call the commander and the captain to the bridge.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "Friendly units approaching, straight in from 2 o'clock,@3 degrees below. <IFF> says they're the watch fleet's@<AM> unit.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "Strange. I wasn't told anyone was coming to meet us.@Azuki, ask them their purpose in...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "Seeker waves from the AM unit!@We've been locked on!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "They mean to attack?! Azuki, any response?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "None!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "It can't be helped. Prepare anti-air defenses!@All mobile units, scramble!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "Hagane - Briefing Room",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "SRX Team, scramble.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "Is the enemy the <Zovorg>?@Or something that came out of the Cross Gate?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "Neither. It's the watch fleet's <AM> unit.@They've already locked on to the Hagane.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "Seriously?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "Why would our own side do that...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "To find out why, Aya, Mai,@use the <T-LINK System> to sense@what's going on with the pilots.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "That is, if anyone's aboard.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "Got it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "Let's go, everyone.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "You got it!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "...Hey, Ryoto. Could the Cross Gate Watch Fleet@be using unmanned <Armored Module>s,@and they went out of control?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "Like in the <Bartolle Incident>?@I'm not so sure...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "But that shower of light from the Cross Gate@caused massive comms and network outages,@didn't it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Save the guesswork for later.@The PTX Team's scrambling too.@Ing's already gone.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "Tenia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "...Hey, Calvina.@Are we gonna fight the Federation Army?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "If they're really trying@to do something to us, yes.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Why do we have to be the targets, anyway?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "Who knows. But whatever they are, if they get@in the way of my goal, I won't show any mercy.@You be ready for that too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "O-Okay.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "(I can't stop in a place like this either.@I've got no choice but to go with Calvina...!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Friendly units decelerating, entering Range 3!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "Any response from them?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Still none.@They keep ignoring our warnings.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "Miles",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Still no contact@with the Strong Arc?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "We keep calling,@but no response there either.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Has a mutiny broken out in the fleet?@Either way, I must seek instructions@from the Joint Chiefs...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Don't tell me we're standing by until orders come?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "That's right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "At least we could put distance between us,@or have the Hagane take a detour...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "That would delay our arrival in Cross Gate Space.@Besides, you should have sought my orders@before launching the mobile units, too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "...My apologies.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "Lieutenant Irm, they've locked on to us.@That means they mean business.@So why isn't there an order to attack?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Waiting on the brass's call, I guess.@Whether that turns out well or badly...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "You've got to be kidding.@I'm not getting shot because of that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "I hear you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "(...Anything in my way, I'll eliminate.@All the more if it's after my life.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "Aya, Mai. Can you sense anything?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "This feeling... Like there's a haze over it...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "There's no... trace of thoughts.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "Meaning there are no pilots aboard?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "It's possible.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Spiria 0 to Steel 2.@Please check whether the Cross Gate Watch Fleet@has any unmanned mobile weapons deployed.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "Roger. Inquiring.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "Meanwhile, we'll get a little closer@and check for life signs...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "The friendly units opened fire!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "What!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Commander. As of now, I will treat@those friendly units as targets.@Is that acceptable?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "I-It can't be helped. Permission granted.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "Doesn't look like autopilot.@What, are they possessed by ghosts or something?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "That might be the right way to put it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "It's like someone is controlling them...@I think it's dangerous to get careless and close in.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "Yes, I have a bad feeling about this too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Spiria 0 to all units. We'll disable the friendlies.@But don't make contact with their units.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "So basically, don't get close to 'em.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "Right. Destroy their thrusters with@mid- to long-range fire.@But don't shoot them down.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "Units that made contact with the targets@appear to have been disabled!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "What!? What's that supposed to mean!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "...Can we communicate with those units?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "Yes, the pilots seem to be fine.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "Then have other units cover them. This ship will@lay down suppressing fire too. Subdue the targets, fast.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "All targets have stopped moving!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "All units, maintain all-around alert.@XO, select one target and investigate it outside@the ship. Take every care with contact.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Understood. Selecting one target for investigation.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "Hagane - Hangar",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "So the pilots were aboard the whole time...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Yeah. And they say there was no device allowing@remote control, and no sign of hacking or viruses.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "So they really were coming after us?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "No.@When the pilots were recovered, all of them were@comatose. So they were asleep during the battle.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "Whaa?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "They're awake now,@but apparently none of them remember what happened.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Some hypnotism.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "But wiping out the evidence that clean?@That's less a hypnotist and more a magician.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "Maybe there was never any evidence@to begin with.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "Then it's a wizard. Did they cast a spell@or something? Bibbidi-bobbidi-boo?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "That's Cinderella.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "They may have some serious power, but they didn't@push very hard. If they wanted to sink the Hagane,@they should've come in as close as they could.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "True, we were waiting on orders from above.@If they'd just quietly closed in, we couldn't@have touched them.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "If things went badly, we might've been controlled too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "But they fired first...@Did they have no choice but to shoot,@or was that the plan all along?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "If they weren't trying to take us out,@and weren't trying to control us either,@then what were they after?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "If attacking us was the point in itself...@they were holding us up, or buying time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "...On our side, I deeply regret to say,@we ended up losing one Peregrine-class ship.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "Things were that chaotic...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "The pilots have no awareness of mutinying.@It seems their units moved on their own@while they were unconscious.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "Same as here. Did you see any change@in the Cross Gate during the battle?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "Every ship had to pull away from the Gate@to bring things under control... but nothing@seemed different from before the incident.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "Commander, Chairman Daniel of the Joint Chiefs@is calling.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "Colonel Humphrey, you heard that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "Sir. Then, if you'll excuse me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "Then put the chairman through.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "Roger. Connecting.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "Daniel",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "It seems you ran into a strange situation,@Brigadier General Miles.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "Sir, we're investigating the cause.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "As it happens, similar incidents have occurred@on the ground too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "That light burst... from now on we'll call it@the Cross Gate Burst. Several enemy forces@are using the chaos to work in the shadows.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "And there have been frequent skirmishes with them,@mainly in the Japan region...@Izu Base has already been attacked twice.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "(No...!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "In light of this,@I'm rescinding the order to send the Hagane@as reinforcements for the Cross Gate Watch Fleet.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "Return to Izu immediately.@The Hiryu Custom will also cut its trial voyage@short and come back.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "So you're gathering the full strength@of the Steel Dragons at Izu.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "That's right.@New orders will follow once you've returned to Izu.@Any other questions?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "You said there are several enemy forces...@What is there besides the <Zovorg> and Ares Geist?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "According to the <Special Tactics Instructor Unit>,@who fought them in Hokkaido, they're remnants@of the Dark Brain.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "Wha...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "(Remnants of the Dark Brain...?!@Something like that existed...?!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}